    </p>
    <div class="nbd-status-legend">
      <span><span class="nbd-badge nbd-badge-ok">Listening</span> process + port open</span>
      <span><span class="nbd-badge nbd-badge-info">Starting…</span> process up, port not ready</span>
      <span><span class="nbd-badge nbd-badge-stale">Stopped / stale</span> leftover state</span>
      <span><span class="nbd-badge nbd-badge-bad">Down</span> not running</span>
      <span><span class="nbd-badge nbd-badge-rw">Writable</span> peer can write</span>
